open-smc-pad firmware
=====================

Our code is under the MIT license (LICENSE):
  boot/                       the DFU bootloader and the installer
  smcpad/arduino/             the runtime (smcpad_rt.h) behind the Arduino core
  smcpad/usb/                 the BR25 USB device driver for TinyUSB, descriptors, glue
  smcpad/smcpad_*.c           debug channel, fault handler, flash driver
  smcpad/examples/smcpad_test/, smcpad/examples/idle/app_idle.c (rewritten)
  build.sh, the build scripts and linker script patches

The rest of smcpad/ (app_main.c, version.c, board/, config/, include/, modules/, the other
examples/) comes from JieLi's AC63 Bluetooth SDK, https://github.com/Jieli-Tech/fw-AC63_BT_SDK,
"Copyright JieLi Technology", licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE-2.0), with
our changes (board configuration for the SMC-PAD, task table, BLE hooks). The SDK itself, with
its precompiled libraries, is a submodule of the umbrella repository and is not part of this
one.

TinyUSB (MIT, hathach) is used from its own repository.
